        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuse Pokémon-style creatures with Hearthstone-inspired combat in this fast, strategic card battler. Build 30-card elemental decks, level your cards mid-match, and climb the ranked ladder through Solo quests, PvP duels, automated tournaments, and seasonal events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/1622929e2ea2ddf939f888ebcff762a1.poster.avif?t=1766712283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/1622929e2ea2ddf939f888ebcff762a1.webm?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/1622929e2ea2ddf939f888ebcff762a1.mp4?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fracctal TCG distills the thrill of monster collecting into a one-versus-one card game built for quick, tactical showdowns.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>eight elemental teams</strong>—like Fire, Ice, Plant, Rock, Psychic, Electric, and more. Master mono-element decks or blend types for clever combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hearthstone-like resource curve.</strong> Both players start at 2 mana and gain +1 per turn (max 10), keeping matches brisk without runaway snowballing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30-card decks, 20 HP, fairy hero powers.</strong> Every draw matters; teched counters and tempo swings decide the match in under ten minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card evolution.</strong> Let a creature survive three of <i>your</i> turns and it morphs into a stronger form—protect it or pay the price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/41ae28867a6bc623d05b339cf587d081.poster.avif?t=1766712283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/41ae28867a6bc623d05b339cf587d081.webm?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/41ae28867a6bc623d05b339cf587d081.mp4?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hero powers (Fairy skills).</strong> Fire blasts  damage, Plant heals, Rock builds armor, Psychic forces discards, and more—one use per turn, so timing is everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level-up progression.</strong> Win games, complete daily quests, and earn currency to enhance your favorite cards or unlock fresh archetypes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo &amp; PvP content.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial Mode that teaches core mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice and level up your skills in Solo Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked PvP Ladder with seasonal resets and cosmetic rewards.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automated &amp; Custom Tournaments</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in daily or weekly automated tournaments for in-game currency, rare cards, or cosmetic rewards.  Bracketed matchmaking and prize distribution handled seamlessly by our backend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love crunchy card math or flashy creature battles, Fracctal TCG offers depth for veterans and an inviting tutorial for newcomers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/152fe3c02d117e4008121c993b313613.poster.avif?t=1766712283\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/152fe3c02d117e4008121c993b313613.webm?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/152fe3c02d117e4008121c993b313613.mp4?t=1766712283\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Element-based deck-building</strong> (8 teams, hundreds of cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving minions</strong> that transform mid-battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fairy hero power system</strong>—eight play-styles right out of the box</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure, Solo, Ranked, and Custom</strong> play modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily, weekly, &amp; guild challenges</strong> with generous progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasonal expansions</strong> that add new mechanics without power-creep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-platform with iOS, macOS, Android, and PC</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3752950/extras/ec04d45badb3a8c1d3d6588d9030f9b5.avif?t=1766712283\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
